{
 "file": "06BLK02C base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:2f",
   "ptr": "0x2f",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "「うれしいじゃねえか、え？\\f",
   "en": "\"Now ain't this a pleasure, eh?",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:4f",
   "ptr": "0x4f",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　なあに、ちょいと見させてもらったよ、\\n",
   "en": "I caught that little scuffle of yours just now. Been a while since I saw swordplay that thrilling.",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:7a",
   "ptr": "0x7a",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "  さっきの立ち回りをよ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02C:4f"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:97",
   "ptr": "0x97",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　ひさしぶりだったぜ、あんな胸のすく\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  さっきの立ち回りをよ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02C:4f"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:c0",
   "ptr": "0xc0",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "  ような剣さばきは。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02C:4f"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:da",
   "ptr": "0xda",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　どうだい？　モノは相談なんだが・・・\\n",
   "en": "Whaddaya say? Got a proposition for ya... Wanna put that skill to work? I'll find ya a good job.",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:105",
   "ptr": "0x105",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　あんたの腕を使って仕事をしてみない\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02C:da"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:12e",
   "ptr": "0x12e",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "  か？\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02C:da"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:139",
   "ptr": "0x139",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "　いい働き口を紹介するぜ？\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  か？\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02C:da"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:159",
   "ptr": "0x159",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　もちろん、仲介料はもらうけどよ、そ\\n",
   "en": "Sure, I take a broker's fee, but in return I'll sell ya for as much as I can get.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:182",
   "ptr": "0x182",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  の分、おれがあんたをなるべく高く売\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02C:159"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:1ab",
   "ptr": "0x1ab",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  り込んでやるさ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02C:159"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:1c2",
   "ptr": "0x1c2",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　悪い話じゃねえだろ？　どうするね？」",
   "en": "Not a bad deal, right? What'll it be?\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  り込んでやるさ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:218",
   "ptr": "0x218",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "「そうか！　よし、話は決まった！\\n",
   "en": "\"Great! Then it's settled! ...So, right off the bat, there's somewhere I need ya to go.",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:23d",
   "ptr": "0x23d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　・・・じゃあ、さっそくだが、行って\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02C:218"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:266",
   "ptr": "0x266",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "  ほしいとこがあるんだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02C:218"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:284",
   "ptr": "0x284",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　街の東のいちばん高いとこに、ゲンハ\\n",
   "en": "A noble named Genhas lives up at the very top of the east side of town. I'll put in a word, so go see him.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:2ad",
   "ptr": "0x2ad",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  スって貴族が住んでいる。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02C:284"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:2cc",
   "ptr": "0x2cc",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　話は通しておくから、そこへ行ってく\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  スって貴族が住んでいる。\\n",
