   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　何しに来たのか知らねえが、お前みた\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　クライツェンは騎士の国だ。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK02C:564"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK02C:5ae",
